' stats.bas — mediation and moderation (communication-science staples).
' Mediation (X->M->Y): a/b/c'/c paths by OLS plus a bootstrapped indirect
' effect. Moderation: simple slopes of X at levels of W. Point estimates
' verified against statsmodels OLS; the bootstrap CI is gBASIC-seeded
' (Preacher & Hayes percentile method). Fixed 80-row dataset.
